CITY ENGINEER'S OFFICE
2101O'Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming82001
A COMMUNITY OF CHOICE
MEMO
TO:
Honorable Mayor Marian J.Orr, City of Cheyenne
Members of the City Council, Cityof Cheyenne
FROM:
Wesley D.Bay, P.E., Deputy City Engineer
DATE:
February5,2019
SUBJECT:
Professional Service Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and Short Elliott
Hendrickson (SEH) Inc.for the design of Sunset Drive and Miller Lane
Improvements Project.
Please find the attached Professional Service Agreement between the City and SEH Inc.for
engineering services related to the addition of asphalt paving and curb and gutter to the
aforementioned streets.Design limits for Sunset Drive will be between Quincy Road and
Kornegay Court encompassing one city block.Design limits for Miller lane will be between Sunset
Drive and Townsend Place encompassing two city blocks.
Engineering Staff evaluates fee proposals for engineering services based on time andmaterial
estimates for the specific project. Those costs are readily tracked and verified during design
operations and the City only pays for the actual time expended.We believe this agreement will
provide the required services to complete the design portion of the project.
The fees include services for project management associated with the design, topographical
services will be a cost not-to-exceed $50,260.31.Funding for this project will come from the 2015-
20185th Penny sales tax.We respectfully request your approval of this professional services
agreement.
```

